<title>USA: Endocare gets $1.5 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Endocare gets $1.5 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Endocare Inc said it secured a two-year, $1.5 million borrowing facility from partnerships managed by Technology Funding, a venture capital firm.</p>
<p>It said the credit will be used to aggressively market its new CRYOcare cryosurgery equipment for treating prostate cancer, and to help in the development of its third-stage office-based therapy for prostate enlargement.</p>
</text>
